meta {
  name: User Login Verify
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/user/login/verify
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Accept-Language: oz
  X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
  X-Device-Name: {{deviceName}}
  X-Device-Platform: {{devicePlatform}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "phone": "{{userPhone}}",
    "code": "{{userCode}}"
  }
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.getStatus() === 200 && res.body && res.body.token) {
    bru.setEnvVar("userToken", res.body.token);
    bru.setEnvVar("userId", res.body.user.id);
  }
}

docs {
  Kirishning 2-qadami: kod tasdiqlanadi va token beriladi (`200`).

  Javobda `token`, `expires_at` va `user` keladi; token `userToken` ga yoziladi.
  Token 24 soat yashaydi va `user_sessions` jadvalidagi qator bilan bog'langan —
  logout qilinsa yoki sessiya bekor qilinsa darhol ishlamay qoladi.

  Xatolar `User Register Verify` bilan bir xil: noto'g'ri kod, urinishlar tugashi,
  muddat tugashi. Bundan tashqari foydalanuvchi bloklangan bo'lsa `403`.
}
